Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
Empty-right gate spacing and the limits of reconstruction iteration\
\>", "Title",
 CellID->874461601,ExpressionUUID->"22a1a762-10e3-861e-525e-3f4ca097ed64"],

Cell["Troy Lowry; OpenAI Codex \[Bullet] 2026-10-24", "Author",
 CellID->36768919,ExpressionUUID->"4da796ef-9f57-a4bf-7b5c-0fc91ae30e85"],

Cell["\<\
A certified 16-cell forward invariant proves exact spacings three or five in \
the empty-right driven gate from white cycle 146 onward. Its eight-column \
reconstruction translation applies once, but the required spacing fails after \
transformation. Two checked examples also refute unconditional iteration and \
a universal sixteen-cell white-gap bound. The reconstructed left row is not \
proved infinite, and no prize problem or eventual period two is excluded.\
\>", "Abstract",
 CellID->1699946459,ExpressionUUID->"1b39f900-6440-cee7-4ac6-f16a0dfa94cd"],

Cell["Scope and source", "Section",
 CellID->1535504786,ExpressionUUID->"75d93363-5da6-51a4-23e6-ab4d5453238e"],

Cell["\<\
This essay is prepared for human review and has not been submitted to the \
prize API. It proves an unbounded driven-gate spacing theorem, a structural \
identity, and exact obstructions to stronger extrapolations. It does not \
prove CQ01Empty, exclude eventual period two or solve a prize problem. The \
empty-right gate is realized by the actual driven system; no finite-right \
realization of the separate period-five or period-31 example gates is \
asserted.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1208482393,ExpressionUUID->"25a568a6-87a2-527f-535a-810032572145"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The one-step identity follows the informal identity in ",
 ButtonBox["morpholib Theorem 14",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/\
777865115483d310f72f0b9511b45409e330a8f5/docs/RULE30_PRIZE_SUBMISSION.md"], 
    None}],
 ". That source is credited for the identity. The Lean formalization, support \
transfer, exact preservation criterion, packed-cone soundness theorem and \
counterexamples here were developed by Troy Lowry with OpenAI Codex. No claim \
of literature priority is made. The source's advertised global period-two \
elimination is not used as a premise."
}], "Text",
 CellID->28909615,ExpressionUUID->"00d7f70d-8d0e-ae34-30ec-ef5724b8f51e"],

Cell["The identity and its required condition", "Section",
 CellID->193832008,ExpressionUUID->"2f3e8453-9762-68ea-56c5-1e1d22173a30"],

Cell["\<\
Let b_G(2r)=!G(r), b_G(2r+1)=1 and D G(r)=G(r+2) xor G(r+4). Call G spaced \
when black cells never have distance one or two. For every spaced G, every m \
>= 1 and every time t, the kit's scalar reconstruction satisfies\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->684317082,ExpressionUUID->"5902d484-617f-9570-0f31-cdee100bfc5a"],

Cell["    recon b_G (m+8) t = recon b_(D G) m t.", "Text",
 CellID->528485616,ExpressionUUID->"56e0e12c-de7d-6135-7e9f-f889db08301f"],

Cell["\<\
An initial support bound W transfers to W-8. The preservation criterion is \
exact: D G is spaced if and only if G(r+4)=0 for every r. Thus this \
particular spacing hypothesis cannot be carried through a second step for an \
infinite gate. Other renormalizations remain possible.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1392207227,ExpressionUUID->"5708d032-2150-04f2-7d37-ca7c50e56ed8"],

Cell["The actual empty-right gate", "Section",
 CellID->705466992,ExpressionUUID->"3b7807e8-9504-b25a-6907-9eb21cb600a0"],

Cell["\<\
Let u(s) be position one at physical time 2s+1 of the right half driven by an \
alternating black-first center, starting with an entirely white right half. \
Set G(r)=u(146+r). A forward invariant of 13,937 sixteen-cell prefixes \
contains the actual prefix at physical time 293. The certificate checks all \
262,144 eighteen-bit cases, including every possibility for the two unseen \
right cells. It checks both closure and six-cycle gate observations. \
Induction therefore proves, at every later time, that black observations are \
separated by exactly three or five cycles, and that no six-cycle gate window \
is all white.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1350516518,ExpressionUUID->"166f8969-5e31-e8e5-3e14-21335bc5bacf"],

Cell["\<\
The packed engine is proved equal to the kit's driven evolution, with \
explicit tail-dependence lemmas. The search that generated the wall is \
untrusted; every certificate case is checked by ordinary kernel reduction. \
There are no native decision procedures or added axioms.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->907546795,ExpressionUUID->"234f1fb7-07c6-bba9-5174-96f1b27009f3"],

Cell["\<\
The translation applies once to this actual spaced gate. Its transform is \
provably not spaced, so the same lemma cannot be iterated on it. Infinitely \
many black gate observations do not establish infinitely many black cells in \
the reconstructed initial left row. That remaining assertion is CQ01Empty, \
which this essay leaves open.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->814772321,ExpressionUUID->"6ee45b93-a0df-d1f6-169c-52dcd16ba3dc"],

Cell["Independent finite observations", "Section",
 CellID->1054628905,ExpressionUUID->"0a3edd72-e0d3-62fb-3bc5-d53f916630c1"],

Cell["\<\
The following scalar reconstruction compares 12,800 cells. It also checks a \
period-five counterexample to applying the translation twice, and seventeen \
white initial cells at depths 528 through 544 for a period-31 gate whose \
black spacings are only three or five. These observations are independently \
connected to the kit's scalar reconstruction by Lean below.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->2043779557,ExpressionUUID->"6ec9a758-58be-624c-16f6-3f02594b3096"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Independent", " ", "scalar", " ", "reconstruction"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"finite", " ", "observations", " ", 
     RowBox[{"only", "."}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
     RowBox[{"spacingColumns", ",", " ", "spacingReport"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"spacingColumns", "[", 
      RowBox[{
      "gate_", ",", " ", "depth_Integer", ",", " ", "horizon_Integer"}], 
      "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\n", "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
        "old", ",", " ", "current", ",", " ", "next", ",", " ", "result", ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"count", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"horizon", " ", "+", " ", "depth"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
       "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"old", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
          RowBox[{"False", ",", " ", "count"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"current", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"EvenQ", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Not", "[", 
              RowBox[{"gate", "[", 
               RowBox[{"Quotient", "[", 
                RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
             "True"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"count", " ", "-", " ", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"result", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"old", ",", " ", "current"}], "}"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"Do", "[", "\n", "    ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"next", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Xor", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"current", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"[", 
                  RowBox[{"t", " ", "+", " ", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"Or", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"current", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"t", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"old", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"t", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
                 "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"Length", "[", "current", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
                 "2"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"old", " ", "=", " ", "current"}], ";", " ", 
           RowBox[{"current", " ", "=", " ", "next"}], ";", " ", 
           RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
            RowBox[{"result", ",", " ", "current"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
          "    ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "depth"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";",
         "\n", "  ", "result"}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"spacingReport", "[", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
        "cases", ",", " ", "checks", ",", " ", "g5", ",", " ", "dg5", ",", 
         " ", "ddg5", ",", " ", "c", ",", " ", "c2", ",", " ", "mismatch"}], 
        "}"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
       RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
         "Periodic", " ", "gates", " ", "with", " ", "minimum", " ", 
          "spacing", " ", "three"}], ";", " ", 
         RowBox[{
         "no", " ", "use", " ", "of", " ", "simulated", " ", "Rule30", " ", 
          RowBox[{"output", "."}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"cases", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
            RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", "False"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
            RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Mod", "[", 
               RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", "3"}], "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "0"}]}], 
            "]"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
            RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Mod", "[", 
               RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", "5"}], "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "0"}]}], 
            "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
            RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"Mod", "[", 
                RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", "8"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
           "\n", "    ", 
           RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
            RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "5", ",", " ", "8"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
               
               RowBox[{"Mod", "[", 
                RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", "13"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
          "}"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"checks", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"g", " ", "=", " ", "gate"}], ",", " ", "dg", ",", " ",
                "a", ",", " ", "b"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"dg", " ", "=", " ", 
               RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
                RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"Xor", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"g", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"r", " ", "+", " ", "2"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"g", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"r", " ", "+", " ", "4"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
                "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "    ", 
              RowBox[{"a", " ", "=", " ", 
               RowBox[{"spacingColumns", "[", 
                RowBox[{"g", ",", " ", "48", ",", " ", "64"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
              " ", 
              RowBox[{"b", " ", "=", " ", 
               RowBox[{"spacingColumns", "[", 
                RowBox[{"dg", ",", " ", "40", ",", " ", "64"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
              "\n", "    ", 
              RowBox[{"And", " ", "@@", " ", 
               RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
                RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"a", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"m", " ", "+", " ", "9"}], ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"t", " ", "+", " ", "1"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "==",
                    " ", 
                   RowBox[{"b", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"m", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"t", " ", "+", " ", "1"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                  "\n", "      ", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"m", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "40"}], "}"}], ",", 
                  " ", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "63"}], "}"}]}], 
                 "]"}], "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"gate", ",", " ", "cases"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
        "  ", 
        RowBox[{"g5", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
          RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Mod", "[", 
             RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", "5"}], "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "0"}]}], 
          "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"dg5", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
          RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Xor", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"g5", "[", 
              RowBox[{"r", " ", "+", " ", "2"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"g5", "[", 
              RowBox[{"r", " ", "+", " ", "4"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
         "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"ddg5", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
          RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Xor", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"dg5", "[", 
              RowBox[{"r", " ", "+", " ", "2"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"dg5", "[", 
              RowBox[{"r", " ", "+", " ", "4"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
         "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"c", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"spacingColumns", "[", 
          RowBox[{"g5", ",", " ", "17", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
        RowBox[{"c2", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"spacingColumns", "[", 
          RowBox[{"ddg5", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
        "  ", 
        RowBox[{"mismatch", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"c", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"18", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"c2", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";", "\n",
         "  ", 
        RowBox[{"<|", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\"\<FiniteExperimentsOnly\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",",
